### ==========================================
### 1. REGISTRAR ABASTECIMENTO (POST /vehicles/:id/refuelings)
### ==========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}/refuelings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "date": "2026-06-01T10:00:00.000Z",
  "liters": 50.5,
  "totalValue": 315.00,
  "odometer": 15000
}


### ==========================================
### 2. REGISTRAR SEGUNDO ABASTECIMENTO (Para gerar histórico e cálculo)
### ==========================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}/refuelings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "date": "2026-06-10T14:30:00.000Z",
  "liters": 40.0,
  "totalValue": 250.00,
  "odometer": 15500
}


### ==========================================
### 3. LISTAR ABASTECIMENTOS DO VEÍCULO (GET /vehicles/:id/refuelings)
### ==========================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}/refuelings?page=1&limit=10&order=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ==========================================
### 4. OBTER RELATÓRIO DE CONSUMO (GET /vehicles/:id/consumption)
### ==========================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}/consumption?startDate=2026-06-01&endDate=2026-06-30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}